st y = position.y; if (typeof x === 'number') el.style.left = x + 'px'; else if (typeof x === 'string') { if (x === 'center') { el.style.left = '50%'; el.style.transform = (el.style.transform || '') + ' translateX(-50%)'; } else el.style.left = x; } if (typeof y === 'number') el.style.top = y + 'px'; else if (typeof y === 'string') { if (y === 'center') { el.style.top = '50%'; el.style.transform = (el.style.transform || '') + ' translateY(-50%)'; } else el.style.top = y; }. Coalesce duplicated transform spaces: if x and y are both 'center', the transform string becomes ' translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%)'. (7) EXPORT renderComponent as named export. (8) UPDATE apps/scene-engine/src/renderer/asset-renderers/index.js: ADD import { renderComponent } from './component.js' AT TOP and APPEND registerRenderer('component', renderComponent) to the side-effect block. (9) REFACTOR apps/scene-engine/src/renderer/asset-renderers/css-effect.js: REMOVE local loadedStylesheets + ensureStylesheet, REPLACE with import { ensureStylesheet } from './stylesheet.js'. After this task, a layer { type:'component', asset:'press-start', position:{x:'center', y:'75%'}, properties:{} } renders the blinking PRESS START at horizontal center / 75% from top.",
